959f9da?source=rss----dbe7a689f76f---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-use-bigdecimal-in-java-accurately-id4khneaj","summary":"The first thing that comes to mind is to use float and double data types. The developers need to know what data type of Java is appropriate for representing floating-point values, especially monetary values. Using BigDecimal(double) is extremely dangerous because it may lose precision and unpredictable results.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/688ff11cab08aecccc76f4e60814cbf3","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-24T13:43:18.359Z"},{"id":"3OOFJP38U","title":"4 Ways to fix LetsEncrypt SSL Generation with Traefik in Kubernetes","url":"https://medium.com/quick-code/4-ways-to-fix-letsencrypt-ssl-generation-with-traefik-in-kubernetes-ec438127b765?source=rss----dbe7a689f76f---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/4-ways-to-fix-letsencrypt-ssl-generation-with-traefik-in-kubernetes-3oofjp38u","summary":"Traefik will also generate SSL certificates using letsencrypt. LetsEncrypt has some rate limits to ensure fair usage. If you hit the error too many certificates already issued for exact set of domains then your traefik container probably restarted more than 5 times because every restart leads to a certificate renewal.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/88385ff207656f2dd700ec56d406477c","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-24T13:42:40.775Z"},{"id":"QVTXKtkJO","title":"5 Free Online Courses for Beginners to learn Vue JS","url":"https://medium.com/quick-code/5-free-online-courses-for-beginners-to-learn-vue-js-86103aaeb2b?source=rss----dbe7a689f76f---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/5-free-online-courses-for-beginners-to-learn-vue-js-qvtxktkjo","summary":"Vue.js is easy to integrate into existing projects and is a good option for building refined Single-Page Applications (SPAs) It is a top-rated free Vue JS course on Udemy with a 4.8 out of 5-course rating and a 2-hour 38-minute length.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/431498d9e6d11b74f8bcf7d36923790e","num_upvotes":12,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-23T20:02:40.937Z"},{"id":"4rGle8Qev","title":"7 Free Online Flutter Courses to learn App Development","url":"https://medium.com/quick-code/7-free-online-flutter-courses-to-learn-app-development-a7cf7e6b7ca4?source=rss----dbe7a689f76f---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/7-free-online-flutter-courses-to-learn-app-development-4rgle8qev","summary":"Flutter is a cross-platform software development kit created by Google. The course will introduce you to Flutter, a high-performance and intuitive framework for building Android and iOS apps from scratch. It is a top-rated free Flutter course on Udemy with a 4.0 out of 5-course rating and a 1-hour 41-minute length.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/b437758cd1e434f4e636379d87f935fd","num_upvotes":12,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-21T20:03:22.500Z"},{"id":"hmNk5jrgN","title":"Go Programming Language: Worth Learning in 2022? \ud83e\udd37\u200d\u2642\ufe0f","url":"https://medium.com/quick-code/go-programming-language-worth-learning-in-2022-%EF%B8%8F-c403af814d48?source=rss----dbe7a689f76f---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/go-programming-language-worth-learning-in-2022--hmnk5jrgn","summary":"Go Programming Language is simple, easy to understand, and syntax-free. Since Google introduced Go in 2009, it has gained traction thanks to the help of companies like Google, Netflix, Uber, etc. Many developers adore the features of this programming language, such as structural typing and garbage collection.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--HRgLpUt6--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2003","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-17T03:33:08.883Z"},{"id":"5sllJrr5J","t